{
 "_doc": "Materials the native renderers draw with, by name (native/src/render/render_context.h). pool_gain 0.2115 (lamp_glow; the road's is its own, 0.9): the Roadcraft 4.0's pool, opacity 0.32 of a #ffe2c4 light, times daylight.json sky_gain 0.661, which carries a colour drawn without light from three.js's tone chain into this game's; computed and not fitted to a picture. Colours as '#rrggbb', textures as res:// paths. prop lens_roughness and lens_ior: the signal lens, polished polycarbonate (Physically Based database, physicallybased.info, 'Plastic (PC)': roughness 0, index of refraction 1.5848 from refractiveindex.info). Vegetation wind (_shared gust and sway; vegetation.gdshaderinc; its speed and direction are shader globals, not material values): sway_per_ms2 = top bend per (m/s)^2 from Peltola et al. 1993 (crown-centre bending under 5 cm on a 13.5 m pine at 8 m/s: 0.0037 of the height, times (1/0.6)^2 to the top, over 64); gust_m = 22 x 10 m (Kaimal et al. 1972 spectral peak n z / U = 1/22); turbulence = 1 / ln(10 m / 0.05 m) (EN 1991-1-4 eq. 4.7, terrain category II); sway_hz = natural frequency of leafy trees of 8-15 m, 0.2-0.3 Hz (Jackson et al. 2019). vegetation_cards cover_per_mip 0.25: alpha rescaled by mip level so a card keeps its coverage far away (Golus 2017, Anti-aliased Alpha Test: The Esoteric Alpha To Coverage). vegetation roughness 0.8: modelling choice for matte leaves, no published value.",
